forks are compared with their originals, as "fetch" does.

GitHub is asked through gh, one question per repository; without gh, or
with --offline, those checks are left out.

OPTIONS
      --offline    do not ask GitHub
      --days N     the age from which pending work is reported (default 7)
  -v, --verbose    show the healthy repositories and the notes too
  and the common options, see: $PROG help

The exit status is 1 when there is a problem, 0 with warnings only.
EOF
}

